@baseUrl = http://localhost:50142

### 1. Đăng nhập lấy JWT Token (Admin)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@petshop.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Lưu token Admin
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Đăng nhập lấy JWT Token (Staff)
# @name loginStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@petshop.com",
  "password": "Staff@123"
}

### Lưu token Staff
@staffToken = {{loginStaff.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Đăng nhập lấy JWT Token (Customer)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@petshop.com",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### Lưu token Customer
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.data.token}}

### =======================================================
### TIÊU CHÍ 1: 5 APIS CRUD SẢN PHẨM (Thành viên 1)
### =======================================================

### 1.1 GET All Products (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 GET Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 POST Create Product (Yêu cầu quyền Admin hoặc Staff)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Pate Whiskas Vị Cá Thu 85g",
  "description": "Pate dinh dưỡng thơm ngon cho mèo mọi lứa tuổi",
  "price": 25000,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "Food",
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568640347023-a616a30bc3bd"
}

### 1.4 PUT Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Thức ăn Royal Canin cho chó trưởng thành (Updated)",
  "description": "Thức ăn hạt cao cấp bổ sung dinh dưỡng tối ưu",
  "price": 360000,
  "stock": 95,
  "category": "Food",
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589924691995-400dc9ecc119"
}

### 1.5 DELETE Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/15
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =======================================================
### TIÊU CHÍ 2: 5 APIS CRUD THÚ CƯNG (Thành viên 2)
### =======================================================

### 2.1 GET All Pets (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 GET Pet by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 POST Create Pet (Yêu cầu quyền Admin hoặc Staff)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "name": "Milo",
  "breed": "Mèo Ba Tư",
  "category": "Cat",
  "ageMonths": 3,
  "price": 5500000,
  "description": "Mèo Ba Tư lông xù siêu đáng yêu, thuần chủng",
  "status": "Available",
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583511655857-d19b40a7a54e"
}

### 2.4 PUT Update Pet
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "name": "Buddy Siêu Ngoan",
  "breed": "Golden Retriever",
  "category": "Dog",
  "ageMonths": 4,
  "price": 9000000,
  "description": "Golden Retriever thuần chủng đã hoàn thành huấn luyện cơ bản",
  "status": "Available",
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552053831-71594a27632d"
}

### 2.5 DELETE Pet
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/8
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}


### =======================================================
### TIÊU CHÍ 3: CONTENT NEGOTIATION & MEDIA FORMATTER
### =======================================================

### 3.1 Content Negotiation: Yêu cầu trả về JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Content Negotiation: Yêu cầu trả về XML
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/xml

### 3.3 Custom Media Formatter: Yêu cầu trả về CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: text/csv

### 3.4 Định dạng không hỗ trợ -> Server trả về 406 Not Acceptable
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/pdf


### =======================================================
### TIÊU CHÍ 4: TRUY VẤN ODATA
### =======================================================

### 4.1 OData Filter: Lọc sản phẩm có giá > 200.000 VNĐ
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Products?$filter=Price gt 200000

### 4.2 OData OrderBy: Sắp xếp theo giá giảm dần
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Products?$orderby=Price desc

### 4.3 OData Select: Chỉ lấy các trường Id, Name, Price, Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Products?$select=Id,Name,Price,Category

### 4.4 OData Pets: Lọc thú cưng thuộc loài Chó (Dog)
GET {{baseUrl}}/odata/Pets?$filter=Category eq 'Dog'

